WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.408
Today the two letters meet.

2
00:00:01.858 --> 00:00:04.437
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:07.989
Write the word bed. Show your child that it looks like a bed.

4
00:00:08.439 --> 00:00:10.418
The first letter is the head of the bed.

5
00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:13.647
The last letter is the foot of the bed.

6
00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:18.975
Bed. The word is bed.

7
00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:26.654
From now on, this is your child's own check. Not sure which letter it is? Write bed in the corner of the page, and look.

8
00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:31.090
Your child traces the word on the page. Then they color the boxes.

9
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.162
The first letter of bed is colored red. The last letter of bed is colored blue.

10
00:00:36.962 --> 00:00:43.638
Do two boxes together. Then step away. At the end, your child writes both letters and the word bed for you.
